3. CODE LICENSE — LIMITED PERMISSION
===============================================================================

The code structure (HTML markup, CSS rules, and JavaScript logic) may be
studied, learned from, and adapted for personal, educational, or non-commercial
use ONLY under the following conditions:

  1. Complete replacement of branding and content. You must remove or replace:
       - All Reyrove branding, the logotype, the favicon, and the tagline
       - The name "Reyhaneh Daneshdoost" and "Reyrove" everywhere they appear
       - All images, project descriptions, tutorial entries, writing entries,
         and prose
       - All trademark references and the copyright metadata pointing to Reyrove

  2. Attribution. If you publish a site substantially derived from this code
     structure, include a visible credit such as:
       "Site structure inspired by Reyrove (reyrove.github.io)."

  3. No trademark use. Your derivative work must not use the Reyrove name or
     logo in any way that could imply endorsement or origin.

  4. No commercial resale of the code as-is. You may not sell, sublicense, or
     redistribute the code as a template, theme, starter, or product without
     the express written permission of the copyright holder.

If you are unsure whether your intended use is permitted, contact the copyright
holder first.

